{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch24oUecEdh4cXfy6Asgp", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off with a PASS verdict at 0.55 confidence. The one defect I filed was not reproduced by the developer, so the sweep is not fully clean.\n\n**Filed:** Subtask badge on \"Pack for trip\" reads 1 instead of 2 when \"Show completed subtasks\" is off and one subtask is completed. It reads 2 when the setting is on with the same completed subtask. The developer could not reproduce it.\n\n**Checked and working:**\n- **Sorting and grouping:** sort and grouping direction toggles update the sheet and list order, and persist across HOME and relaunch. Grouping by due date and by start date (\"No start date\") renders correctly, and descending order reverses the list.\n- **Subtasks:** expand and collapse work, completing a subtask and using Undo works, and the badge shows 2 with both subtasks visible.\n- **Search:** matches title, notes and subtasks; ranking follows the active sort (ascending and descending give reversed orders); no-match shows the empty state; opening a result opens the right task.\n\n**Not covered:**\n- Start-date grouping with real Today, Tomorrow or overdue dates, since that needs editing task data.\n- Deeper subtask nesting, since the data has only one level.\n- Landscape beyond one rotation check. The list rendered in a narrow pane, which I did not file.\n\nI restored the sort and grouping settings and the task states to the starting data. One slip during testing: a mis-targeted tap opened a new-task editor from a share action, which I discarded without saving. I also opened the Pay rent and Buy milk editors and backed out without saving changes."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 595, "cache_read_input_tokens": 213885, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 595}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "32eaf94d-ea5c-4e4b-9f71-cfd087a4c3a8", "uuid": "c9041ca8-fe3b-46d0-829f-4d98515ffd6e", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T02:54:50.303Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch24oUNF5m7b6QrqKsC2v"}
